WEDDING#THEATRE
AMOEBA#O#OYSTER
RE#WINDPIPES#EM
PET#SNEERED#ELI
AREA#YANKS#EDEN
TSARS#LES#SLIDE
H#HOTS#D#DIET#S
#HOURIS#SALVOS#
U#USER#R#DOER#A
